      "timestampSeconds": 4563,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4565,
      "text": "Thank you for the encore."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4566,
      "text": "Wait, wait, wait."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4567,
      "text": "Let me..."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4759,
      "text": "It's one way of supporting us."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4761,
      "text": "Please do it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4765,
      "text": "Mugubo, I love you."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4767,
      "text": "That was from me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4768,
      "text": "That was from me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4769,
      "text": "Okay, next."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4770,
      "text": "Kyla."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4779,
      "text": "Slowly, slowly."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4781,
      "text": "We, Holohiro, are the youngest here."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4787,
      "text": "We're the newest unit."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4789,
      "text": "Bro, you're so old at this point."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4792,
      "text": "I mean the unit."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4793,
      "text": "So being together on the stage with everybody, I feel very proud."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4798,
      "text": "And then what should I say?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4800,
      "text": "The senpais, I learned so much from them."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4804,
      "text": "And being able to sing in front of the fans."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4809,
      "text": "I'm really happy."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4813,
      "text": "Thank you so much for everything."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4815,
      "text": "If it wasn't for you guys, for the fans who are here today for Holohiro,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4822,
      "text": "we wouldn't have been able to do anything."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4824,
      "text": "So thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4826,
      "text": "Now we're going to..."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4831,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 4832,
      "text": "Until we become grandpa, grandmas."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5036,
      "text": "We could say Chromatic Future is our first concert, right?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5038,
      "text": "If there's a first time, there will be a second time and a third time."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5041,
      "text": "I like what she's saying."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5042,
      "text": "I like what she's saying."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5044,
      "text": "I like what she's saying."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5048,
      "text": "I hope we can do this again together like this."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5057,
      "text": "Next EOV!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5058,
      "text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5071,
      "text": "The first time I heard EOV was in Japan."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5073,
      "text": "But now I was able to hear it in Indonesia, too."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5075,
      "text": "And I didn't imagine that they would come."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5084,
      "text": "But thank you for acting so cool towards me, guys."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5087,
      "text": "Thank you for supporting us."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5090,
      "text": "Thank you for believing in us."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5102,
      "text": "Thank you, Hololive."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5103,
      "text": "Thank you to the fans."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5107,
      "text": "Don't cry."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5108,
      "text": "Don't cry."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5109,
      "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5110,
      "text": "Let's cry afterwards together."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5112,
      "text": "Cry!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5116,
      "text": "Are you going to cry?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5261,
      "text": "Before we continue, we have a present."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5265,
      "text": "On this special occasion."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5268,
      "text": "Stop kicking her butt, Wayness."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5271,
      "text": "The last song can be recorded."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5279,
      "text": "It's the y'all."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5281,
      "text": "And you can upload it on social media or stream it on YouTube."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5286,
      "text": "Hashtag Hololidocraticfuture."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5288,
      "text": "I should have put that in the title."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5799,
      "text": "I'm gonna lose it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5803,
      "text": "They did so great."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5804,
      "text": "That was so cool."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5806,
      "text": "That was really awesome."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5807,
      "text": "Like, I think they should release it as a Blu-ray."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5810,
      "text": "Because, like, watching it with some, like, sudden quality drops and stuff."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5817,
      "text": "You know, they don't deserve it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5821,
      "text": "Why is there a music player?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5824,
      "text": "Yeah, they deserve their concert to be seen in its full glory."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5828,
      "text": "I hope there will be something like that."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5830,
      "text": "That would be awesome."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5834,
      "text": "Good job, O-Line!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5835,
      "text": "How to say I love you again?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5869,
      "text": "They are pure of heart."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5871,
      "text": "They are pure of heart."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5872,
      "text": "They are all good people."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5874,
      "text": "I've been watching their passion for 5 years now."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6057,
      "text": "What is this guy doing?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6060,
      "text": "He has a tag. Everybody has a tag."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6060,
      "text": "He has a tag. Everybody has a tag."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6062,
      "text": "Or maybe not everybody."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6062,
      "text": "Or maybe not everybody."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6064,
      "text": "Why do some of you guys not have the tag?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6067,
      "text": "Oh, you needed it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6072,
      "text": "Come over here."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6074,
      "text": "Oh, Lap-chan."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6074,
      "text": "Oh, Lap-chan."
    },
