      "timestampSeconds": 6078,
      "text": "Lap-chan."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6328,
      "text": "It was like a one-time thing."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6330,
      "text": "And the New Year's ones and so on."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6333,
      "text": "Those kind of concerts, the online concerts."
    },
    {
